    "start": 1435,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "APP上會顯示配對到的司機名字",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1437,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但車子開來之後",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1439,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "司機並不在方向盤後方",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1441,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "其實駕駛是在遠端負責",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1443,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "把空車開到顧客面前",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1445,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "只要顧客一接手方向盤",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1447,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "遠端駕駛就完成了",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1449,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "這一趟服務",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1451,
    "duration": 16,
    "text": "與其說這是計程車服務",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1467,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "不如說這是一種全新的",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1469,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "汽車租賃模式",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1471,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "需要租車的顧客完全不必",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1473,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "考慮找車或停車的問題",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1475,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "全部都有遠端",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1477,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "坐在駕駛台上的司機代勞",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1479,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "而透過多個高解析度",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1481,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "攝影機和感應器",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1483,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "遠端駕駛也能夠安全地在路上行駛",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1485,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "大大的減少了時間",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1487,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "和空間",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1501,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "這種遠端真人駕駛的無人車",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1503,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "已經在美國堵塵",
